"⟪k:0⟫……但是，⟪k:1⟫祭典的背后也会有阴影存在。⟪k:2⟫在路边水龙头喝着水的劳动者们，⟪k:3⟫脸上写满了疲"
"惫，⟪k:4⟫似乎马上就要支撑不住而倒下。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47b6b3f411cf1242c65596441cae3e281c7ba7e7ac47ebd08314b5d05cbc188c
#. default-sha256: 6f499d1340515d122260033d36ef9e864356886d712947849a3831e54fba1c2a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By way of contrast, I wore fine clothing and had a carriage at my disposal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫和他们相比，⟪k:1⟫我却穿着这样高档的衣服，⟪k:2⟫外出也要乘坐马车……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b46751d443704cd5c1ff0e2fc0526a4fda36b71593656ec0e3a196abc017438b
#. default-sha256: f22968988a7c201bae2737fa5d5c444b58da0d868b050eaf70d22e0cafdde628
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I imagine every day was a struggle for them just to remain afloat."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他们一定每天为了生存就竭尽全力，⟪k:1⟫过着艰辛的日子。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db569a9d6e3afd8f9dddf9ba4c63ee58df554a8fd1a72f642a16ff455b2200e5
#. default-sha256: 9de543ff1f59eaa9691aa8d6716efc0fd9c66d8af1c9faa84ee83dc4c8640207
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had I not married the man I had, I too might have found myself on the streets in a similar "
"situation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果我没有和他结婚的话。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我大概也会变成和他们相同的处境吧？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c033f0e322c0fbe72d786bc98c0b9dc44f0eac66a1f44433859535e079db96a
#. default-sha256: 15e52360f0b7a6df8694f1e271e27cd59167cefa4be8eca71d6a4dc4d16e6017
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not relief that spread through my breast at the sight of them—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was "
"pangs of guilt."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫一点点涌上心头的，⟪k:1⟫并非安心，⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫而是接近于罪恶感的情绪。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c023dffafd12ccf9f21750726ce3f543ee50d3d430a2d86d8eddcb4302bd9c18
#. default-sha256: bca60dab259dd535e47f2fd73cffdb18061169ca0ee1015390709c4742e1a4a5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It felt to me like a life of opulence was wrong—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sinful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫拥有财富，⟪k:1⟫能够维持高层次生活水平这件事……让我感到罪孽深重。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c24e0da25a71fd67c6e069d4eca3abab7d84a5201073cdc9464c947927c8b1b
#. default-sha256: 49201b5e5645a602f9b29c20e435b9ffd8ea3705ee7ce8687209f61f7d6252c8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It broke my heart to know that I was living so much better than them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只有我过着舒服的生活。⟪k:1⟫我对此于心不安。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f74922a44f1f2ca3a43968ae5f310dd646b124ef8cad19ef0cb10b9f61415da8
#. default-sha256: c1a52bdd6b6b3786c417c89a7779c4273798694e551a0cc14c8825474f411d45
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo snorted disapprovingly at me,⟪k:1⟫seemingly reading my mind, and then said,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫他大概察觉到了我那时的神情。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不高兴似的哼了一声，⟪k:3⟫这么说道。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1eab6d3ca5e8575c08b496e695cf4f22827eb0b821c34fd627386fe372b842c
#. default-sha256: 8d5fda472d10975f496c83895420a92ddaa4f7f2bd9d9b33cb5393f0898b68c6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The poor man who envies the rich, covets his wealth, and finds the ambition to make the same "
"for himself; and the rich man who pities the poor, thinking it his duty to give them offerings of "
"philanthropy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫嫉妒生活富足者，⟪k:1⟫想要爬上高位的野心。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫怜悯生活贫穷者，⟪k:4⟫想要施与恩惠的同情"
"心。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e4f5e444751503dffae003fb2b2ef278088a56bff4ceb98c7b4e14e5e4f605a
#. default-sha256: df6b89ab197e67bf95cd04159448965820b05160029b6c308c55cc35f5e6cf66
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To me, the latter is the far more nefarious.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Excessive charity will ruin a man—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫make him come to ⟪k:5⟫expect⟪k:6⟫ handouts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫对我来说，⟪k:1⟫后者才是罪孽深重的一方。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫多余的施舍会让人堕落。⟪k:4⟫因为人们会习惯于"
"不劳而获。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 86059bce502a6e61d1ad8d7ec2fd56cff4d21d5a8184f55a4b375cfa0c50100f
#. default-sha256: 085eb08c6b3b6b28b30e2e3129121340f4b4aa9946964366fe95beecca1c2f0d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then there are those with the wrong idea of pity,⟪k:1⟫who let themselves fall down to "
"the same place,⟪k:2⟫mistakenly believing it will somehow make the poor feel better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫而且——搞错了同情方式的家伙，⟪k:1⟫自己也会跌落到同样的处境。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫这是因为他们会误以为，"
"⟪k:4⟫自己处于同样处境就是对穷困之人补偿的缘故。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f362753828c3b1a6ba2fd05de4a980ed3c5f85f0c27e75713aeb4b0da3e03088
#. default-sha256: a9253950b4097b48cd4936a137836721a9b403c92dd9b30fa7d381fa6f30cd0a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What a joke.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you’re going to do anything for them,⟪k:3⟫you might as well "
"encourage them to climb upward.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Spur on economic growth and the flow of capital."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫真是可笑。⟪k:1⟫与其变成那样，⟪k:2⟫谁都想着往上爬才好。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫这样金钱也能流通，⟪k:5⟫经济也"
"能得到发展。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60d53a206dc1bb0318ef723a24d7227b6e3e7b926b96d8a861571dd594063947
#. default-sha256: 0fb8d0094918fbf2a7d5ab7c398837974dc2609b328b0ca800a7e04c55e0916d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doesn’t that sound like the better option?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这不是更好吗？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4eb4803b8e740c8788c39acf22969730f74632ed5e45193c287ae2cb73a455b7
#. default-sha256: d170833740dac5a38268f4ad1d15b61c0fd50e2127f11ae9cb48e6d603cf8008
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say nothing, simply smiling and giving an ambiguous nod."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我不知如何回应，⟪k:1⟫模棱两可地笑着点了点头。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc8324ec18c89b33e408f420d38411261bb5dd1b62079303c5453fd14a3bd1d4
#. default-sha256: d68d5287cbc1b8c60aea7785d72c29ab6feab120af7aedf427fd5a6ccceb69d3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had a point—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫my sympathy and guilt meant nothing to people actually experiencing "
"hardship."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫确实，⟪k:1⟫我所怀有的罪恶感，⟪k:2⟫还有同情心……对于处在不幸处境的人来说，⟪k:3⟫没有任何意义。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d91a205121b0abe29732be69d427f46318d6ee4a9a19e42c386f80e08a1f732
#. default-sha256: 70b1cbd493a13e0c779061dd46c9af1498e0c605b3b61ab6eebda00a2bfd1b71
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If, feeling guilty of my own fortune, I acted upon that pity in the way he had described, it "
"would accomplish little more than self-satisfaction."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即使对自己的立场感到愧疚，⟪k:1⟫让自己变得跟他们一样，⟪k:2⟫也不过是自我满足而已。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17c7e289e5f192f7229f292dbdcf740ffb2be984d6e924eaefabde1ab2802b26
#. default-sha256: b54f4bb5bd3ab6b1e285c2aa889cea8cea01b14a923af0a801e26859fa9fa5d2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to have seen straight through to my very core."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他或许早就看穿了我这种人的心思。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫本来，⟪k:3⟫他就是依靠资产运作而渐渐积累起财富的人。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95e5dead40a8a66daba1343ccfd8edf74b9c1b7fc39695815b49618363bcfff9
#. default-sha256: 33472d902561cde1879d5939c1a7a95ae0cc3d939d11bc43cc3b609675ba952b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This was a man who had built his own fortune through investment, which I imagine required "
"him to be rather astute."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫一定有着杰出的观察力吧……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4aaace1410c8294a69acfb618b218e8da8e104611c5950af82006523604f5d27
#. default-sha256: c2102127bf136ae5d1f78f1cde194e8edb363c4bee8361159f2f4d95ed0875cd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But doesn’t a world where everyone is constantly trying to climb higher and higher sound "
"rather... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫exhausting?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不过……⟪k:1⟫谁都一心想着向上爬的世界，⟪k:2⟫会不会太辛苦了呢？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02ea8d964326bb687ce48d19c70558a896d304d26138883c111c9af8604eebfc
#. default-sha256: 25990d914bf04c6eef2bb3faf960d93338ba267567b76a860c17a1f769574776
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, would prefer to be in a position where I could watch—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫if only from a "
"distance—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as others climbed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即使只是在远处也好，⟪k:1⟫我也想守望……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫那些奔波不停的人们。⟪k:4⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36f260e6fd79e1db0fcc72acc32aaf53d147e145b532bd4e9ae22d2347ce4122
#. default-sha256: 11ff3dd444c3c606e3494e7bcd1711138740203efce7bf413b960332eb96d547
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But obviously, I could not say as much to him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫当然，⟪k:1⟫这些话我没能说出口……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd61f9da6847971e0434223e043bd20f1976ce9bb440d406ec06f05b8e030a88
#. default-sha256: 83905b3143da6ab2c2373ba6a54a27fe69de609438c4901dee7ac92a4b4871a8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB5E04E7_26DF_4498_AA3D_BF948827CA0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Some time later, the carriage came to a stop in front of a shop."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……终于马车在某家店铺前停下了。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c7a88d65c9a798ffcc9ce6b82e069bd65bd37ef81a4420838a94f021c9d8c3a
#. default-sha256: a70a2f8e6726cfd6544082c19ad52d1e18cbde4cbdfec21afc706067721401d9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BBEABC7_9248_4DD0_B475_4022BDF38225"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As I looked at the building perplexedly, he gestured to the door with his chin, signaling "
"for me to get out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫面对充满疑惑的我，⟪k:1⟫他只是抬抬下巴示意我「出去」。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1994d02a3d2117cbb450242bcf72dc152fa8641aef94846c690d26cd06b28004
#. default-sha256: ccc1bc903f8c0df444d92ff1007157698f30db01d96ce079a582d9be876318ad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5F2E2CD1_5675_47B5_88A9_30D721AC5D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lost and confused, I stepped down from the carriage,⟪k:1⟫and before me spread a showcase "
"behind a large glass window."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不明所以地下了马车，⟪k:1⟫映入眼帘的是玻璃制的展示橱窗。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8f33f7a9a0d6bb2bcd62d6147597bd1a3edca31d3c00efeb71fe1ec7c86929a
#. default-sha256: 94e3008c4064a67224ca659c2665f501cbdad75d731da0b07b5a20919ddfbed5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8FA62325_56EE_4756_B4ED_B3B1168F68DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, lined up in the case were not precious metals or expensive clothing, ⟪k:1⟫but "
"machines."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫橱窗里摆放的既不是贵重金属也不是洋服。⟪k:2⟫摆在里面的是——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06190be5a814a82a79a7524915818db891413690e9d5a5d50cf7e44d23bfdb31
#. default-sha256: d739d33046e08ea5282d948d738695cbe3efb5605e307fb1d8eb33f34c8550e2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0B8281B_8022_40D2_9847_71A7F98CAB60"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At first, I had no idea what kind of devices they were."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫机器。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫我一开始，⟪k:3⟫完全不知道它们是做什么用的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8A105800_7BFB_4FAD_A2F3_F81F309E90F6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6ef37cda5832f67197942943c658f1642129d1955f62b19c100f90d3c7c4df4
