#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53a79b26a479759ae5ed70b3125e4bb0bf7fd1d06087172b6014cef4ddf0ae3d
#. default-sha256: 9c4d8e9e3e4e6bb8970270383d5ef00c4314575b3e19b007b5c6f4dbbe52fc6a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But curiously enough, I was not at all put off by his behavior."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫可是，⟪k:1⟫真不可思议呢。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫我一点都不讨厌他这样的态度。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f78b6bee226ddee7918e557d20edf73023c78bd4201c97150f7d46a21675594
#. default-sha256: d276d990f233f618d74a4448d911be6d5d9ed6ead9d027bc5de8c1de91ff7029
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When the sun set, the carriage made its way to a nearby hill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫夕阳西沉，⟪k:1⟫我们的马车向着山丘的方向驶去。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd970ef71bec693dc8a8596f3cd4b505aeea8c7beea5a6c06f6835c97409851e
#. default-sha256: 071a9306d7d27809c7517df4203c54133b5e51cc16a1422156d7555faed4951f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cool nighttime breeze felt wonderful on my skin, flushed from the alcohol, and the light "
"from the gas lamps had a comforting warmth to it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫宜人的夜风吹拂着微醺泛红的肌肤，⟪k:1⟫煤油灯的灯光给人带来暖意。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49d71afa11a03352a4dc59c9811c10e950e923c538ceaf6e41db222f5a9b2a4c
#. default-sha256: b605b6c316ef377899eaf7b7b0155d670b93d339d5ba1a9e426b7a855ddaf6f5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Jacopo had complained about the quality of the wine, once he had intoxicated himself, "
"his mood improved visibly. ⟪k:1⟫It made him unexpectedly talkative."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫他虽然抱怨着葡萄酒的品质，⟪k:1⟫但也因为喝醉的缘故心情变得很不错。⟪k:2⟫话也格外多了起来，⟪k:3⟫"
"这么向我说道。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a99d42ed2c8fec4da05486f9b44d75877a6f3ecaf65d03ecdba64288fd8ac4e7
#. default-sha256: 8e0c26af6f2b4edaf794b1d7aec32bee15a1d31bd20baafba35220db2ccff177
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Look out at the city.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A gloomy town that shuts "
"down at night isn’t suited to expansion or growth. But this city isn’t like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫看吧，⟪k:8⟫这条街道多么热闹。⟪k:9⟫到了夜晚就一片寂静、"
"⟪k:10⟫毫无生气的城市，⟪k:11⟫不适合发展经济。⟪k:12⟫但是，⟪k:13⟫这里不是这样的。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd13a1d5f90f33ea7161bae785438b0d1ec15b76522fc1b9a0d22569efb7f1d3
#. default-sha256: 6731eff7e241ac472bb15fd21624fc4bcba9e8d4d30fc7b6690dff76708a9377
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You can see people walking beneath the lamps,⟪k:1⟫and you can hear the bustle of them "
"talking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫煤油灯下能看到人影，⟪k:1⟫也能听到热闹的声音……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f28abf056eee44776d90944bad61a21750d14b93d935c5f14dd3e7a7c53df63d
#. default-sha256: c8962acbb9ffed340b33e2dea13749c6ead18d9ae19622ee73e769c8e612ca8a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is a city that still has plenty of room to grow.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As they ride the rising wave "
"of the economy,⟪k:3⟫many, many more people will gather here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这条街，⟪k:1⟫还有很大的成长潜力。⟪k:2⟫乘上经济发展的巨浪，⟪k:3⟫居民还会不断增加的吧？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e8c4e666ab86aca18d6149d39ae4844ce1e38cd10a1bc9799ac922c4b9cc781
#. default-sha256: f0aac4967c4880913a705d846d9f1675f158d6fd6793dddd55f293232573c6c6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More people means more money in circulation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫More money in circulation means the "
"city grows,⟪k:3⟫companies are founded, and more goods are bought and sold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫人多起来的话，⟪k:1⟫金钱也能更好地流通。⟪k:2⟫金钱流通起来的话，⟪k:3⟫街道就会更为繁荣。⟪k:4⟫出"
"现大大小小的公司。⟪k:5⟫物资也开始流通。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_49676B00_307A_485B_A463_06A11753C9AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08399eef6357d6d902f89313e8b61f11d997e470a8e50f17f12197ec1c57f991
#. default-sha256: d374b66b38be830d4bfb81fdd5d58d0b2fd1dae2150c211ac61444f871082189
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49676B00_307A_485B_A463_06A11753C9AE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Will it really change so drastically?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫会产生这么大的变化吗……？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4254602ac9429bb6b90b27819b0b8a2cdbafc8a483c3184f008c6211e73ed31
#. default-sha256: d173335bfd0b6e96fca549b6ad3e6482cfa41a34a31c6019d4c9d2b4ae21b998
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It can be difficult to see what’s happening from the inside.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The majority of "
"people just go about their daily lives,⟪k:4⟫and the next thing they know, things are different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫当局者迷，⟪k:2⟫人们很难发现自己正处在变革之中。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫大多数人只是凑合着过活，⟪k:5⟫而"
"在此之间世界正悄然改变。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f22e417fd190f318a46da3afb162619b9060620bf181070c8d19868649460fc4
#. default-sha256: 4571a1a8ca17c6825021a685621c6032c3d63e4da0d57e23356906fb4b075d9b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’d wager most don’t notice the changes at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫不对——⟪k:2⟫可能他们甚至连世界已经改变了这件事都没有注意到。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C6C73090_D254_45AD_A1CB_9FE8662CAAFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccd20844313da034758899c6281335e8ffc56c49ccbbcc8df92af93badac28f2
#. default-sha256: 57353d79d81aff2da93b79c89c8c5d69be510b62cb31453f3a24a51bcf0ca858
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C6C73090_D254_45AD_A1CB_9FE8662CAAFC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only those with eyes sharp enough to realize what’s happening can seize success. ⟪k:2⟫I "
"cannot afford to overlook even the most minute change."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫只有敏锐察觉到变革之人，⟪k:2⟫才能获得成功。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……正因如此，⟪k:5⟫绝不能错失良机。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C29F2513_568B_450D_B77C_A53EDD33F045
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c6914444c08dc664b63213fe0e33fc89fde08e7fa266eee9b8f065395f801a1
#. default-sha256: 2f1a235a2ebf829427c59f62d030c807803d0fbf0231f328a7fba37683aa0179
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C29F2513_568B_450D_B77C_A53EDD33F045"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Do you have... ⟪k:2⟫a dream of some kind?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫你……怀揣着梦想的吧？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CECB563B_414E_41C5_B847_5E0AD4392C78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83d05e4a7a4fafbf378af380e8b7a77ea61ba2350fa061564659ecc21764e0c2
