msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A dream? I’m not sure if it’s easy enough to attain to call a dream. ⟪k:2⟫Others might "
"call it greed—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫or perhaps ambition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫梦想……⟪k:2⟫我也不清楚是否能简单称之为梦想。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫他人可能称之为贪婪，⟪k:5⟫或者野心。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A6B61D0F_0F48_4645_A129_7AB9539C130F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 780f01bf774b92898109ef7161e40e1555294d9ee4d671d4e462b5bc63818e11
