msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t laugh, now.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My intention... ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is to make the world mine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫你可别笑话。⟪k:1⟫我呀——⟪k:2⟫准备掌控这个世界。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1F5A7FC2_1014_4BFD_BB44_B3C7137C281A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4b03f6658e565803860670d4a434a58afd5961aebd1c91c8d3d688dd00d0265
