msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1F5A7FC2_1014_4BFD_BB44_B3C7137C281A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The world..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫世界……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E76E4A67_8AF1_4E9E_B980_C8B65E3584E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f24eddbce6fcc7ca60c08952825708e8f01927e95389223fce5e1e84be9f633
#. default-sha256: 7046747141904686959ec344128417910ce8247d9237b53c4807b916b5b45636
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E76E4A67_8AF1_4E9E_B980_C8B65E3584E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Yes, the world. ⟪k:2⟫And to do that, you need neither physical strength nor kindness—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but money and influence. ⟪k:5⟫People have no choice but to kneel before those forces."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫啊啊，⟪k:2⟫没错。⟪k:3⟫为了掌控世界，⟪k:4⟫需要的既不是暴力也不是温柔。⟪k:5⟫是金钱和权力。"
"⟪k:6⟫人们不得不屈服在这两样事物的面前。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_AE0A56A8_93E1_4142_9227_BF1F768E2ECC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
