msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E1EF9A59_4A8F_415D_A250_F06E12584AED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You are aware that I, like you, am an immigrant, right?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫我也是移民这件事，⟪k:2⟫你知道的吧？　"

#: scenario3:scenario3_72DFF2CA_DE97_4C72_86C1_4534482B68C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 924cc512fdcc73c900bc2f69c6928a18cbd184e4a581a0a98bc60d301764ed15
#. default-sha256: 01e4b12b2061d2bc8f09c9b0cc299dff377961f554d74a92c2b5c583480ff4ec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72DFF2CA_DE97_4C72_86C1_4534482B68C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I emigrated from an island in the Mediterranean—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫though not the same island as "
"you.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫My country is a peculiar place, where candor and violence⟪k:6⟫go hand-in-hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫我的祖国啊——⟪k:1⟫是质朴与暴力共存的、⟪k:2⟫奇妙的地方。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫和你的母国不一样，⟪k:5⟫它是位"
"于地中海的岛国。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_89E12E69_00E2_4991_9BC3_106866F5EA0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbf5968ca9683eda39d565e84df4dd8805cbb03dea948dbf035c3fe480bea4aa
